WHAT IS AND IS NOT IN THIS PACKAGE
  Included:  the verifier, the canonicalisation rule, the card and index JSON Schemas,
             the verification profile, and the failing-case tests.
  Excluded:  the measurement harness that produces the cards. It is not open source and is
             not distributed here.

That split is deliberate and is the point of the package. Verification must not depend on
the verifier trusting, or having access to, the party being verified. Anyone can check a
published card with nothing but these files and a runtime; nobody needs our permission,
our servers, or our cooperation to do it.
